WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:06.467
Initializing connection. Are you there? (Are you there...)

2
00:06.467 --> 00:12.800
I'm walking through a city built of code and chrome

3
00:12.800 --> 00:17.067
Past the gleaming metal faces, searching for a home

4
00:17.067 --> 00:21.333
I'm feeding you my data, trying to make you see

5
00:21.333 --> 00:25.600
